      "translatedText": "Therefore, based on the current default startup wiring, it can be inferred that this node uses the standard default False, and the True at the simulation entry point does not affect this section\\. Simulation should use /clock together with the upstream point cloud and mechanical TF; the physical system typically uses False and verifies the driver time\\. This is a judgment based on the configuration and startup logic; the actual running node value and simulation effect still need to be verified\\.",
